/P 135 0 R
/E (Each year, our team eagerly participates in the Makers Fest, beautifully organized by our local libraries. This event connects us with the community and allows us to share our enthusiasm for STEM education. We volunteer at the Ozobots table, introducing children to coding basics and the exciting world of STEM. These small yet captivating robots ignite curiosity and excitement in parents and kids alike. By showcasing Ozobots' capabilities, we hope to inspire a lasting interest in the exhilarating world of FIRST, motivating young minds to explore and innovate.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
