/E (In recognition of Cybersecurity Month, our team delivered a presentation for the local senior center focused on internet safety. We addressed essential topics, including password security, identifying scammers, and distinguishing between human-generated content and artificial intelligence. As technology and AI continue to evolve rapidly, we aim to ensure that everyone remains safe across all digital platforms. This presentation allows us to aid seniors in preventing  real-life danger while helping them discover measures to stay safe as technology grows more complex.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
