/E (This past offseason, we wanted to use the momentum we had built to use our platofrm for FIRST education. Our Bot Toks Season was born. In this series, we break down tons of skills, experiencses, and challenges related to competing in robotics. As of ep.33, we have made over 100,000 impressions through Bot Toks alone and acquired over 140,000 views! We love this series because it gives us the opportunities to connect with and educate students across the globe)
