/E (In the coming year, our objective is to introduce the FIRST Tech Challenge \(FTC\) to homeschooled students, while also providing mentorship opportunities for both the children and their parents. Within our community, there is a significant deficiency in STEM education for homeschooled children, and as RAPTORS, we are committed to addressing this gap.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
