/P 141 0 R
/E (This year, we successfully hosted two sessions of our LEGO SPIKE CAMPS. For the summer of 2026, we plan to expand our offerings to six sessions, accommodating 30 children each, ultimately reaching a total of 180 participants. Our goal is to inspire these young minds to pursue interests in both STEM and robotics.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
